{"4740270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "stardozing", "steam_appid": 4740270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-up and cave-dive</strong> with your friends in stardozing! Work your way to the bottom of a deep, procedurally generated cave, <strong>throwing</strong> around the items you find along the way and up to 3 other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740270/extras/7e005e845af066b931d65fc608023efe.poster.avif?t=1787272237\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740270/extras/7e005e845af066b931d65fc608023efe.webm?t=1787272237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740270/extras/7e005e845af066b931d65fc608023efe.mp4?t=1787272237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up for up to <strong>4-player</strong> co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock character customization options to personalize your starbear! Every player gets a unique star shape for their belly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new cave generates every game, with multiple diverse <strong>biomes</strong> to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items wisely to traverse tricky caves!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect some <strong>physics-based</strong> chaos. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta